{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/423ae7c06cbef20a8f79bc772109352d.poster.avif?t=1768544003\" width=366 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/423ae7c06cbef20a8f79bc772109352d.webm?t=1768544003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/423ae7c06cbef20a8f79bc772109352d.mp4?t=1768544003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cartoon killers</strong> is a video game inspired by the iconic Team Fortress 2 and by cartoons from what the devs can pull out of their heads, and with intentionally coded &quot;game mechanics&quot; , and tons of characters to customize and master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/901a21080f95860fdbee97a1dfb8571f.avif?t=1768544003\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras_big/901a21080f95860fdbee97a1dfb8571f.webp?t=1768544003 width=1560 height=357 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as a band of <strong>misfits</strong> inspired by your favorite <strong>boomer shooter</strong> and watch as they all collectively gladiate against each other in a battle verse <strong>red and blue</strong> over nonsensical <strong>control</strong> <strong>points, flags, and payloads!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/1769c91bdfb6518a335cd79ebc4bbf02.poster.avif?t=1768544003\" width=366 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/1769c91bdfb6518a335cd79ebc4bbf02.webm?t=1768544003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/1769c91bdfb6518a335cd79ebc4bbf02.mp4?t=1768544003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Kill each other :) (in game lol)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/1dd6066244af43b5cc9e7dca19a610ef.avif?t=1768544003\" width=341 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Have fun taking over ether by being a sweat in a lobby or being a silly friendly with a meal to give to\u00a0 <br>the people you love!\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/b667aa39b5992f27524bc3e62376d6ff.avif?t=1768544003\" width=544 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Try to figure out which art style we use!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/e503e78c721438a02ef5f0127f672e2d.avif?t=1768544003\" width=900 height=594 /></span>Have silly moments in-game! such as this...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/6a13eb1ead12d1074897106721d697d2.avif?t=1768544003\" width=900 height=594 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Or kill each other over random crap that happens in game because life happens :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/146c988b672af7d807ba8f0dece3277e.avif?t=1768544003\" width=900 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Oh yeah and you might <strong>fight</strong> these <strong>weirdos</strong> in the future too! Probably as some sort of <strong>boss</strong> thing where you<br>do this cool thing where you shoot a <strong>gun</strong> at them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/749a81c1ef831d5b1cec969ca7954d3e.avif?t=1768544003\" width=740 height=571 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/42890e1e4304eafeeeb6557b8dd8db08.avif?t=1768544003\" width=544 height=514 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077200?t=1768544003","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/7c2b020ac4b63f2d7cd40f2fd910b5454a4dab23/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768544003","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/2c6d4a71ffe3244a8838f8a1fb34ee481e3e0537/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768544003","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/2c6d4a71ffe3244a8838f8a1fb34ee481e3e0537/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768544003","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36